  /Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-1a52au/curator-spec-worktree/profiles/manager.md\nf531688492ecd08c2b3a33658ce308e7ff7bd32b00ba67cc8d349a7fd85c2ab7  /Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/curator-spec/protocol/core.md\nf531688492ecd08c2b3a33658ce308e7ff7bd32b00ba67cc8d349a7fd85c2ab7  /Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-1a52au/curator-spec-worktree/protocol/core.md\n9661d66bae38f8448974a76281482be2bae6d399eeefb58f588352e7c14abe17  /Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/curator-spec/decisions/0004-compile-only-build-drivers.md\n9661d66bae38f8448974a76281482be2bae6d399eeefb58f588352e7c14abe17  /Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/.temp/TASK-260728-1a52au/curator-spec-worktree/decisions/0004-compile-only-build-drivers.md\n M SECURITY.md\n M profiles/manager.md\n M protocol/core.md\n?? decisions/0004-compile-only-build-drivers.md\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
