node has `.csk-install.json`. Managers MUST read marker\n577:continue to regard a valid marker-v1 installation as current for a schema 1\n580:Marker v2 permits `skill_schema_version` through 6 and requires sorted\n584:`builds` entry records driver, logical cache key, `receipt_sha256`, artifact\n586:the immutable cache artifact selected by the effective plan and marker, not the\n596:member order and whitespace are not significant.\n598:An installation is current only when the marker schema is supported; ref kind,\n601:`content_sha256`. For a build-enabled marker, currentness additionally requires\n604:receipt input; each logical cache key and manager-derived artifact path to\n605:match; and every referenced receipt/artifact to validate below a currently\n607:runtime-copied build-root file, untrusted boundary, corrupt receipt/artifact,\n608:wrong target or toolchain, or mismatched source identity makes the installation\n612:Unsupported or unreadable markers are not current. A moved tag is a warning,\n615:The marker and its referenced receipt hashes are not signatures and MUST NOT be\n617:reverified from signed records when fresh trust is required.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
