ors, compatibility guards, and rc.5 release gates pass.\nblockedBy:[]\nblocks:[]\nderivedBlockedBy:[\"STORY-260720-35dck7\"]\nderivedBlocks:[\"STORY-260728-1ojb1p\"]\nchecklist:[]\nnotes:\ncreated:2026-07-27T20:19:19Z\nupdated:2026-07-27T20:25:18Z\nisBlocked:false\nisAdvisoryBlocked:true\nchildren:[\"TASK-260728-17sclp\",\"TASK-260728-1a52au\",\"TASK-260728-3b8qym\",\"TASK-260728-wy3dsw\"]\npreconditionResources:[]\noutcomeResources:[]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
