{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_74","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'task-board m --help'","aggregated_output":"Execute a write operation against the board using the DSL.\n\nMutations:\n  set_status(ID, status=..., commit_ack=scope_committed?)\n                                        Change status; acknowledge enforced done transitions\n  set_estimate(ID, estimate=..., ...)  Set Task/Bug story-point estimate\n  create(type=..., name=..., ...)      Create element\n  set_details(ID, title=..., ...)      Update README fields\n  rename(ID, name=...)                 Rename element name/slug\n  delete(ID)                           Delete element (destructive)\n  assign(ID, agent=...)                Assign agent\n  unassign(ID)                         Remove assignment\n  link(ID, blocked_by=...)             Add dependency\n  unlink(ID, blocked_by=...)           Remove dependency\n  check_item(ID, item=N)              Check checklist item\n  uncheck_item(ID, item=N)            Uncheck checklist item\n  add_checklist_item(ID, text=...)     Add checklist item\n  set_notes(ID, text=..., set=bool?)   Append/set notes\n  set_parent(ID, parent=...)           Move to new parent\n  add_resource(ID, name=..., content=..., type=..., description=...)\n  update_resource(ID, name=..., content=..., type=..., description=...)\n  delete_resource(ID, name=...)        Delete resource (destructive)\n\nAuth (always local):\n  login(user=..., token=...)           Store token in credentials file\n  logout()                             Remove active user's token\n  switch_user(user=...)                Switch active user for remote\n\nSafety:\n  --dry-run     Preview mutation without applying\n  --confirm     Required for destructive mutations (delete, delete_resource)\n\nIntrospection:\n  task-board q 'schema()'              Show available mutations and parameters\n\nExamples:\n  task-board m --format json 'set_status(TASK-260218-abc, status=development)'\n  task-board m --format json 'set_status(STORY-260218-abc, status=done, commit_ack=scope_committed)'\n  task-board m --format json 'set_estimate(TASK-260218-abc, estimate=estimated, scale=fibonacci, number=5)'\n  task-board m --format compact 'assign(TASK-260218-abc, agent=claude-opus)'\n  task-board m --format json --dry-run 'delete(TASK-260218-abc)'\n  task-board m --format json --confirm 'delete(TASK-260218-abc)'\n\nUsage:\n  task-board m <mutation> [flags]\n\nAliases:\n  m, mutate\n\nFlags:\n      --confirm         Confirm destructive mutations\n      --dry-run         Preview the mutation without applying changes\n      --format string   Output format: \"json\" or \"compact\"/\"llm\" (default \"json\")\n  -h, --help            help for m\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --board-dir string      Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default \".task-board\")\n      --insecure              Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)\n      --json                  Output in JSON format\n      --no-update-check       Disable automatic update check\n      --remote string         Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)\n      --remote-board string   Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
